ṭṭhasutta","w":1,"k":["tadanubhasant"]},{"l":"Tadanubhāsantī","g":"taṁ anubhāsanti, idaṁ purimasseva vevacanaṁ.","v":"12MaA03","n":427,"p":289,"s":"Caṅkīsuttavaṇṇanā","w":1,"k":["tadanubhasant"]},{"l":"Tadanubhāsantī","g":"taṁ anubhāsanti.","v":"19AnA03","n":192,"p":65,"s":"Doṇabrāhmaṇasuttavaṇṇanā","w":1,"k":["tadanubhasant"]}],"Tadanubhāsanti":[{"l":"Tadanubhāsantī","g":"taṁ anubhāsanti, idaṁ purimasseva vevacanaṁ.","v":"03ViT03","n":300,"p":329,"s":"Ādittapariyāyasuttavaṇṇanā","w":1,"k":["tadanubhasant"]},{"l":"Tadanubhāsantī","g":"taṁ anubhāsanti, idaṁ purimasseva vevacanaṁ.","v":"07DiA01","n":285,"p":244,"s":"Ambaṭṭhasutta","w":1,"k":["tadanubhasant"]},{"l":"Tadanubhāsantī","g":"taṁ anubhāsanti, idaṁ purimasseva vevacanaṁ.","v":"12MaA03","n":427,"p":289,"s":"Caṅkīsuttavaṇṇanā","w":1,"k":["tadanubhasant"]},{"l":"Tadanubhāsantī","g":"taṁ anubhāsanti.","v":"19AnA03","n":192,"p":65,"s":"Doṇabrāhmaṇasuttavaṇṇanā","w":1,"k":["tadanubhasant"]}],"Tadanurūpaṁ":[{"l":"Tadanurūpaṁ kammavācaṁ katvā mānattaṁ dātabban","g":"– “Suṇātu me bhante saṁgho, ayaṁ itthannāmo bhikkhu ekaṁ āpattiṁ āpajji sañcetanikaṁ sukkavissaṭṭhiṁ ekāhapaṭicchannaṁ, so saṁghaṁ ekissā āpattiyā sañcetanikāya sukkavissaṭṭhiyā ekāhapaṭicchannāya ekāhaparivāsaṁ yāci. Saṁgho itthannāmassa bhikkhuno ekissā āpattiyā sañcetanikāya sukkavissaṭṭhiyā ekāhapaṭicchannāya ekāhaparivāsaṁ adāsi. So parivutthaparivāso. Ayaṁ itthannāmo bhikkhu ekaṁ āpattiṁ āpajji sañcetanikaṁ sukkavissaṭṭhiṁ appaṭicchannaṁ, so saṁghaṁ tāsaṁ āpattīnaṁ sañcetanikānaṁ sukkavissaṭṭhīnaṁ paṭicchannāya ca appaṭicchannāya ca chārattaṁ mānattaṁ yācati. Yadi saṁghassa pattakallaṁ, saṁgho itthannāmassa bhikkhuno dvinnaṁ āpattīnaṁ sañcetanikānaṁ sukkavissaṭṭhīnaṁ paṭicchannāya ca appaṭicchannāya ca chārattaṁ mānattaṁ dadeyya, esā ñatti. Suṇātu me bhante -pa- so parivutthaparivāso. Ayaṁ itthannāmo bhikkhu ekaṁ āpattiṁ āpajji sañcetanikaṁ sukkavissaṭṭhiṁ appaṭicchannaṁ, so saṁghaṁ tāsaṁ -pa- yācati. Saṁgho itthannāmassa bhikkhuno dvinnaṁ āpattīnaṁ sañcetanikānaṁ sukkavissaṭṭhīnaṁ paṭicchannāya ca appaṭicchannāya ca chārattaṁ mānattaṁ deti. Yassāyasmato khamati itthannāmassa bhikkhuno dvinnaṁ āpattīnaṁ sañcetanikānaṁ sukkavissaṭṭhīnaṁ paṭicchannāya ca appaṭicchannāya ca chārattaṁ mānattassa dānaṁ, so tuṇhassa. Yassa nakkhamati, so bhāseyya. Dutiyampi etamatthaṁ vadāmi -pa-. Tatiyampi etamatthaṁ vadāmi -pa-. Dinnaṁ saṁghena itthannāmassa bhikkhuno dvinnaṁ āpattīnaṁ sañcetanikānaṁ sukkavissaṭṭhīnaṁ paṭicchannāya ca appaṭicchannāya ca chārattaṁ mānattaṁ, khamati saṁghassa, tasmā tuṇhī. Evametaṁ dhārayāmīti– evaṁ kammavācaṁ katvā mānattaṁ dātabbaṁ. Ciṇṇamānattassa ca imināva nayena kammavācaṁ yojetvā abbhānaṁ kātabbaṁ.","v":"03ViT03","n":102,"p":371,"s":null,"w":5,"k":["datab","kamavac","katv","manat","tadanurup"]},{"l":"Tadanurūpan","g":"bhikkhādānānurūpaṁ.","v":"10DiT03","n":214,"p":81,"s":"Sāmaññaphalasutta","w":1,"k":["tadanurup"]},{"l":"Tadanurūpan","g":"tassa saddassa anurūpaṁ.","v":"10DiT03","n":214,"p":81,"s":"Sāmaññaphalasutta","w":1,"k":["tadanurup"]},{"l":"Tadanurūpaṁ payogan","g":"tassa uppattiyā anucchavikaṁ cittassa pavatti-ākārasaññitaṁ payogaṁ, yato sabbe vicārādayo nipphajjanti.","v":"17SaT02","n":368,"p":457,"s":"Satisuttavaṇṇanā","w":2,"k":["payog","tadanurup"]},{"l":"Tadanurūpan","g":"tadanucchavikaṁ, yathāvuttanti attho.","v":"23AbhiT02","n":510,"p":177,"s":"Suttantabhājanīya","w":1,"k":["tadanurup"]}],"Tadanantaresū":[{"l":"Tadanantaresū","g":"tesaṁ cakkavāḷānaṁ antaresu.","v":"04ViT04","n":null,"p":39,"s":null,"w":1,"k":["tadanantares"]}],"Tadanantaresu":[{"l":"Tadanantaresū","g":"tesaṁ cakkavāḷānaṁ antaresu.","v":"04ViT04","n":null,"p":39,"s":null,"w":1,"k":["tadanantares"]}],"tadaññathā":[{"l":"Anāpatti tadaññathā","g":"tato eva vibhaṅgato yenākārena āpatti vuttā, tato aññenākārena anāpattibhedova hoti.","v":"06ViT06","n":43,"p":77,"s":null,"w":2,"k":["anapat","tadanath"]},{"l":"Anāpatti tadaññathā","g":"tato eva vibhaṅgato yena ākārena āpatti vuttā, tato aññenākārena anāpattibhedova hoti